   For executed dispatch origin_availability_alpha: need execute_origin_dispatch (requires dispatch_allocated ?origin_availability, candidate_vehicle_linked ?origin_availability ?vehicle_unit, not dispatched). So we need dispatch_allocated and vehicle linked.

